OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some late brightness.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,8,Fwith clear periods. Becoming chilly in
OL,9,Fsome sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FStarting off dry. Thickening
OL,12,Fcloud will bring outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Ffrom the west in the afternoon along
OL,14,Fwith freshening southerly winds. Drier
OL,15,Fin the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,18,Fbright on Friday. Rain spreading east
OL,19,Ffor a time on Saturday. Drier and
OL,20,Fbrighter on Sunday with the chance of
OL,21,Fa few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
